lue "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462150}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "973fe3d8-28f4-5ce5-afa3-e107736244b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462149} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b065414-05f8-5b5f-b809-0e2f2975f5ea" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462828}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "bd4c2e21-ea3a-5149-9740-8c2a599beff2" :question/math-academy-id "q-124782" :question/problem "Which of the following regions are simply connected?\n- **I.** ${(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,|\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\ne 4}$\n- **II.** ${(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,|\\,x\\ge 1}$\n- **III.** ${(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,|\\,xy\\ne 0}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A connected region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ can be contracted to a point.\n\n![](images/7d/7d6aea1a62fb290702630ef95ec86f4119e7c8fdd74b8148b62b66e5ac871b58.png)\n\nA connected *plane* region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ encloses only points in $D.$ In other words, the region does not contain any holes. Plane regions containing holes are not simply connected, since some simple closed curves cannot be contracted to a point:\n\n![](images/c3/c3c3e7a60ff0dd917cf6c0b293dae7510e457a0455629add1c54cadac65248b7.png)\n\nLet's now examine our regions in turn.\n\n- Region I is *not* simply connected. The region contains all the points of ${R}^{2}$ except those on the ellipse ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=4.$ Thus, the region is formed by two disjoint pieces and, therefore, is not even a connected region.\n\n- Region II  is simply connected. It's a plane region without holes.\n\n- Region III is *not* simply connected.  The region contains all the points of ${R}^{2}$ except those on the coordinate axes.  Thus, the region is formed by four disjoint pieces and, therefore, is not even a connected region.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172669 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172051 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d1af47ea-6253-5d58-9b94-31e52de27106" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Simply-Connected Regions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d2132682-d892-5ab9-bb87-e66b51a6a1d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460499} {:answer/id #uuid "d9edf225-47eb-52d9-9236-490f3c6db5dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460500}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d9edf225-47eb-52d9-9236-490f3c6db5dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460500} :answer-field/id #uuid "2118d6af-4ef2-578c-b102-d393d2fbeab2" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461116} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eccde749-8255-5674-80ee-42a42f6cfc7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460501} {:answer/id #uuid "28f51c6d-3184-5852-b549-1e196a451f34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460502}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eccde749-8255-5674-80ee-42a42f6cfc7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460501} :answer-field/id #uuid "a559e75b-8ff2-5917-899d-8ec81cc20125" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461117} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9eb5b6d1-21dc-5ca5-a087-32ff42346fa5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460503} {:answer/id #uuid "91a9ad8c-64bb-544a-9c5b-62d0b2a8b831" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460504}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91a9ad8c-64bb-544a-9c5b-62d0b2a8b831" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460504} :answer-field/id #uuid "bbbd7b3b-6caf-53d2-85d1-760ead766ae3" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461118} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be18d6eb-994d-5193-848d-ff043f487efe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460505} {:answer/id #uuid "d10a703c-11a3-5f17-b61d-345a7064eb33" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460506}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "be18d6eb-994d-5193-848d-ff043f487efe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460505} :answer-field/id #uuid "1bd05271-ff7a-5e38-870a-c107d034a080" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461119}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "72da8c2e-5747-5cf0-addd-5e327ef519dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-98036" :question/problem "![](images/00/0045eda99f40f774d2ef21214522eebb0c53bffee304ba503a9076a7491cc648.png)\n\nWhich of the regions shown above are simply connected?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A connected region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ can be contracted to a point.\n\n![](images/7d/7d6aea1a62fb290702630ef95ec86f4119e7c8fdd74b8148b62b66e5ac871b58.png)\n\nA connected *plane* region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ encloses only points in $D.$ In other words, the region does not contain any holes. Plane regions containing holes are not simply connected, since some simple closed curves cannot be contracted to a point:\n\n![](images/c3/c3c3e7a60ff0dd917cf6c0b293dae7510e457a0455629add1c54cadac65248b7.png)\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the regions: \n\n- Region I is simply connected. This is a connected region that does not contain holes.\n\n- Region II is not simply connected. Instead, this is a connected region that contains two holes.\n\n- Region III is simply connected. This is a connected region that does not contain holes.\n\n- Region IV is not simply connected. Instead, this is a region that consists of two pieces (it's not connected).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488201 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172050 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d15f8fa8-f265-50da-b172-3ccb90895448" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Connected Regions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ef13c9c-faf4-5aef-baa4-8eeb9c4a3cb8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/54/54762bab5aacfe291771982a4a66377acd555983b5ec04976add0f19a8e0a0fa.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487593} {:answer/id #uuid "5cde0af2-7563-5ac2-994a-0c809446d644" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f2/f29dae26fcd30da0bf17e804ff47339d49e0c364d1ea4ec182bd26f5fc13cc6d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487753} {:answer/id #uuid "6284629e-2013-50e4-87f4-17e13cac44fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218604