n\n![](images/37/37597a2cecae00cca3eacec7265913070de9343be6afb9108644d6c8d0c1d93b.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488220 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172051 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d1af47ea-6253-5d58-9b94-31e52de27106" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Simply-Connected Regions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b8a5532-5c40-544b-a662-5333cce8382a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c0/c0add6c5feca5255760a8bcbd84f68cb425263c857379cb4f1415e8b4e199753.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487715} {:answer/id #uuid "5a9928f1-71c1-540b-85e1-01ff04dab2b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/54/54a73ee1a01be78d548a7e609a05538754e488f57b0a755e7e5f6e2264e14a74.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487750} {:answer/id #uuid "7d6e9b6f-a94b-5109-8c6a-97935704bcdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/65/65e1c034f836802bb8127e754f0e1cb303144468b041d51da2ee1b8a89de1132.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487809} {:answer/id #uuid "9f7781f5-0705-541a-a940-98edef386fd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/94/94e4f7d31dddfd2b960b027848328d1223899ae3172ec2192bc3bd3fc3c0411d.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487864} {:answer/id #uuid "fdfd2f97-0aa0-539a-be6f-7097c1940aee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/5f/5fce5e6fb02581d530afa04ae596290eebeb84265131b397a11621160170f20b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488045}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d6e9b6f-a94b-5109-8c6a-97935704bcdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/65/65e1c034f836802bb8127e754f0e1cb303144468b041d51da2ee1b8a89de1132.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487809} :answer-field/id #uuid "1313a534-7913-5042-9bc0-6c44d0135939" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488061}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6a1d02fe-8171-5afa-b624-bbcbed75b5b0" :question/math-academy-id "q-98687" :question/problem "Which of the following is *not* a simply connected region?" :question/worked-solution "A connected region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ can be contracted to a point.\n\n![](images/46/46305c070e2563b4dacf8b31c88c46b860f003b20ffdff608a5485c09a91bd11.png)\n\nA connected *plane* region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ encloses only points in $D.$ In other words, the region does not contain any holes. Plane regions containing holes are not simply connected, since some simple closed curves cannot be contracted to a point:\n\n![](images/a0/a0459ddbabbd810e43db084f5dd174437340914b53ed227f6ef7ce2e3a0fc383.png)\n\nAmong the given options, the only one that does not satisfy this definition is the following: \n\n![](images/65/65e1c034f836802bb8127e754f0e1cb303144468b041d51da2ee1b8a89de1132.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488270 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172051 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d1af47ea-6253-5d58-9b94-31e52de27106" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Simply-Connected Regions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00693d44-168a-59ae-81ba-7237813361a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487568} {:answer/id #uuid "5e040eb6-7f07-520b-9885-f2312cee4b7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487754} {:answer/id #uuid "8f2829aa-b1bc-5d42-a9ba-b1777c71d30e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487838} {:answer/id #uuid "a7780b16-691d-528d-a79d-418312672210" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487881} {:answer/id #uuid "bd604b74-ca77-53a0-8727-e78e594cc6cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487923}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e040eb6-7f07-520b-9885-f2312cee4b7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186487754} :answer-field/id #uuid "4a7b56f9-4f69-5483-8998-cc50c72ca12a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186488078}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "db6c8509-7f18-5c65-821d-f6d09e6d4e13" :question/math-academy-id "q-98695" :question/problem "![](images/23/2304f9b9080a8b3ec4ff10284cee8e01ec8dff54fb879f7ed55dd7a3f80e2b23.png)\n\nWhich of the regions shown above are simply connected?" :question/worked-solution "A connected region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ can be contracted to a point.\n\n![](images/7d/7d6aea1a62fb290702630ef95ec86f4119e7c8fdd74b8148b62b66e5ac871b58.png)\n\nA connected *plane* region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ encloses only points in $D.$ In other words, the region does not contain any holes. Plane regions containing holes are not simply connected, since some simple closed curves cannot be contracted to a point:\n\n![](images/c3/c3c3e7a60ff0dd917cf6c0b293dae7510e457a0455629add1c54cadac65248b7.png)\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the regions:  \n\n- Region I is not simply connected. Instead, this is a region that consists of two pieces (it's not connected).\n\n- Region II is not simply connected. Instead, this is a connected region that contains a hole.\n\n- Region III is simply connected. This is a connected region that does not contain holes.\n\n- Region IV is simply connected. This is a connected region that does not contain holes.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III and IV only.\""}]}
